## **5. How It Works**

```text
  [ CREATE ]           [ OWN ]            [ AIR ]
    Proto      ➔      Rights      ➔       Reality
(AI + Canvas)      (Proof-of-Rights)      (Live Engine)
```

### **Step 1: Create**
AI Agent + Pro Canvas  
➔ build interactive, data-driven Proto assets

### **Step 2: Own**
On-chain asset, License, Royalty  
➔ generate cryptographic **Proof-of-Rights**

### **Step 3: Air**
Live Engine · Product Runtime · Code Export  
➔ Proto is executed across real-world surfaces

**⚠️ No rights = no execution.**

